# ==============================================
# NOTA: Librerías precompiladas de vendors
# ==============================================
# Los siguientes directorios contienen librerías precompiladas (.a)
# que DEBEN mantenerse en el repositorio:
#   - Libs/niq/libniq-*.a
#   - Libs/uwbstack_libs/delivery/**/lib*.a
#   - SDK_BSP/Nordic/SDK_17_1_0/**/*.a
#   - SDK_BSP/Nordic/SDK_17_1_0/external/**/*.a
#   - SDK_BSP/Nordic/SDK_17_1_0/components/toolchain/cmsis/dsp/GCC/*.a
#   - SDK_BSP/Nordic/SDK_17_1_0/components/802_15_4/**/*.a
#   - SDK_BSP/Nordic/SDK_17_1_0/components/nfc/**/*.a
#   - SDK_BSP/Nordic/SDK_17_1_0/components/proprietary_rf/**/*.a
#   - SDK_BSP/Nordic/SDK_17_1_0/examples/**/*.hex (firmwares de ejemplo del SDK)
#   - SDK_BSP/Nordic/SDK_17_1_0/components/softdevice/**/*.hex (softdevices)
#
# El .gitignore solo ignora *.a en la raíz y BuildOutput/,
# no en los directorios de vendors/SDKs.
